          {
            "title": "Multiple values",
            "id": 88373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuplas são úteis porque nos permitem retornar múltiplos valores de uma função, como as pontuações mais altas e mais baixas de uma lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return</code> seguido de <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma função pode retornar vários valores como uma tupla. Separe-os com vírgula.</p><p>Retorne primeiro <code>highest_score</code> e depois <code>lowest_score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"highest_score\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"max\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lowest_score\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"min\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"highest_score\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"lowest_score, highest_score\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return</code> seguido de <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return a tuple",
            "id": 88377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para retornar uma tupla, codificamos os valores que desejamos retornar separados por uma vírgula <code>,</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "No parentheses",
            "id": 88378,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Embora estejamos retornando uma tupla, os parênteses não são necessários.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return</code> seguido de <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao retornar vários valores, separe-os com vírgula. Não é necessário usar parênteses.</p><p>Retorne primeiro <code>highest_score</code> e depois <code>lowest_score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores_list\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return</code> seguido de <code>highest_score</code>, <code>,</code> e finalmente <code>lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store return value",
            "id": 88379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para armazenar uma tupla retornada por uma função, atribuímos o resultado da chamada da função a uma variável como <code>data</code>, como de costume.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"(80, 17)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>data</code> seguido de <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para armazenar uma tupla retornada, atribua o resultado da chamada da função a uma variável.</p><p>Armazene a tupla em <code>data</code> para o código exibir <code>(80, 17)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"169\" endIndex=\"184\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"(80, 17)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>data</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>get_scores_data</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Retrieve individual values",
            "id": 88380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos então recuperar os valores individuais por seus índices, como a maior pontuação com <code>data[0]</code>, e a menor com <code>data[1]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = data[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest = data[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;smallest score: \" /><text value=\"{smallest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;highest score: \" /><text value=\"{highest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"193\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"229\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"smallest score: 17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest score: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>highest</code> seguido de <code>data[1]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A menor pontuação está no índice <code>1</code> da tupla retornada. Armazene-a em <code>smallest</code> para o código exibir <code>smallest score: 17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = data[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest = data[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;smallest score: \" /><text value=\"{smallest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;highest score: \" /><text value=\"{highest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"219\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"229\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data[0]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"smallest score: 17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest score: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>smallest</code> seguido de <code>data[1]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "When to return a tuple",
            "id": 88381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como as tuplas são imutáveis, retornamos uma tupla quando não precisaremos modificá-la, mas apenas usar os valores, como no caso dos vencedores de um jogo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_top_three\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"top_three = get_top_three(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;First: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Second: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Third: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First: Sue\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second: Ed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third: Ann\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return</code> seguido de <code>players[0], players[1], players[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como tuplas são imutáveis, retorne uma tupla quando precisar apenas usar seus valores, e não modificá-los.</p><p>Retorne os três primeiros jogadores em ordem para o código exibir <code>First: Sue</code>, depois Ed e Ann.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_top_three\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"top_three = get_top_three(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;First: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Second: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Third: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players[1], players[0], players[2]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First: Sue\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second: Ed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third: Ann\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return</code> seguido de <code>players[0], players[1], players[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "When to return a list",
            "id": 88382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando queremos ser capazes de modificar a coleção de valores retornada, como atualizar um membro da equipe, nós <code>return</code> uma lista como <code>team</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"form_team\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team.append(players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team.append(players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team = form_team(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chloe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(team)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"101\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Chloe', 'Ann']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return team</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple values",
            "id": 88670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é um dos principais usos de <em>tuples</em>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Retornando múltiplos valores dentro de funções</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Exibindo valores</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Retornando múltiplos valores dentro de funções.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um uso principal de tuplas é retornar vários valores de uma função.</p><p>Uma função calcula <code>width</code> e <code>height</code>. Qual instrução retorna os dois resultados juntos?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return width, height</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(width, height)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return width</code> seguido de <code>return height</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return width, height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return a tuple",
            "id": 88671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como separamos os diferentes valores ao retornar múltiplos valores de uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usando vírgulas <code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usando ponto e vírgula <code>;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usando vírgulas <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Separamos vários valores retornados com vírgulas.</p><p>Qual linha retorna corretamente <code>lowest</code> e <code>highest</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return lowest, highest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return lowest; highest</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return lowest highest</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>return lowest, highest</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No parentheses",
            "id": 88672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Precisamos de parênteses ao retornar múltiplos valores?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Não, apenas a palavra-chave <code>return</code> seguida pelos valores</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sim, em torno de cada valor individual</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Não, apenas a palavra-chave <code>return</code> seguida pelos valores.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Não precisamos de parênteses ao retornar vários valores, apenas de <code>return</code> seguido dos valores.</p><p>O que <code>return name, age</code> devolve a quem chamou a função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uma tupla contendo <code>name</code> e <code>age</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apenas <code>name</code>, porque <code>age</code> está fora dos parênteses</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Um erro, porque cada valor precisa dos próprios parênteses</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uma tupla contendo <code>name</code> e <code>age</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store return value",
            "id": 88673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos salvar uma tupla retornada por uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Armazenando em uma variável, como qualquer outro valor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos salvar tuples retornados por funções</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Armazenando em uma variável, como qualquer outro valor.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salvamos uma tupla retornada por uma função armazenando-a em uma variável, como qualquer outro valor.</p><p>Qual linha armazena a tupla de <code>get_bounds()</code> em <code>bounds</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bounds = get_bounds()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bounds == get_bounds()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_bounds(bounds)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>bounds = get_bounds()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Retrieve individual values",
            "id": 88674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como recuperamos os valores individuais da tupla retornada por uma função?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pelo seu índice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pelo seu valor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pelo seu índice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Recuperamos valores individuais de uma tupla retornada pelo índice deles.</p><p>A variável <code>profile</code> armazena <code>(\"Mia\", 21)</code>. Qual expressão recupera a idade?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>profile[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>profile[21]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>profile.age</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>profile[1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: When to return a tuple",
            "id": 88675,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando devemos retornar uma tupla?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando estamos interessados apenas nos valores individuais ou não pretendemos modificar a tupla</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando pretendemos substituir valores na tupla</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando estamos interessados apenas nos valores individuais ou não pretendemos modificar a tupla.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devemos retornar uma tupla quando precisamos dos valores individuais e não pretendemos modificá-los.</p><p>Uma função retorna a <code>latitude</code> e a <code>longitude</code> fixas de um local. Qual valor de retorno se encaixa melhor?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uma tupla contendo as duas coordenadas</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Uma lista para substituir uma das coordenadas depois</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Uma string que junta as coordenadas e esconde os valores individuais</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uma tupla contendo as duas coordenadas.</p></body></html>"
          },
